{"path":"chrono/year_month_day_last/operator_cmp","title":"std::chrono::operator==,<=>(std::chrono::year_month_day_last)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>operator==,&lt;=&gt;<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::chrono::year_month_day_last)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day_last/operator_cmp","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Compares the two year_month_day_last values x and y. This is a lexicographical comparison: the year() is compared first, then month().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/chrono\">&lt;chrono&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day_last\"><span class=\"kw2575\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_day_last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day_last\"><span class=\"kw2575\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_day_last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/compare/strong_ordering\"><span class=\"kw2678\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strong_ordering</span></span></a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day_last\"><span class=\"kw2575\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_day_last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day_last\"><span class=\"kw2575\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_day_last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares the two <code>year_month_day_last</code> values <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">y</span></code>. This is a lexicographical comparison: the <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day_last/accessors\"><code>year()</code></a> is compared first, then <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day_last/accessors\"><code>month()</code></a>.\n</p><p>The <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, and <code>!=</code> operators are <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/operators#Comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span></span> and <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span></span> respectively.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>If both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">y</span></code> represent valid dates (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>), the result of the lexicographical comparison is consistent with the calendar order.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> ymdl1<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">11</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/last_spec\"><span class=\"kw2561\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">2020</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> mdl<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/last_spec\"><span class=\"kw2561\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2632\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">November</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> ymdl2<span class=\"br0\">{</span>mdl<span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">2020</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ymdl1 <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> ymdl2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    ymdl1 <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    ymdl2 <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ymdl1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> ymdl2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year_month_day_last","title":"std::chrono::year_month_day_last"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::operator==,<=>(std::chrono::year_month_day_last)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Compares the two year_month_day_last values x and y."},{"label":"Return value","note":"x.year() == y.year() && x.month() == y.month()"},{"label":"Notes","note":"If both x and y represent valid dates (x.ok() && y.ok() == true), the result of the lexicographical comparison is consistent with the calendar order."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":146,"codeBlockCount":1}
